---
title: Asset Changed Event
---
flowchart TD
    %% 1. Ingestion & Event Layer
    subgraph Ingestion ["1. Event Ingestion Layer"]
        a1[File Uploaded to AWS S3] -->|S3 Event Notification| a2[AWS SQS Queue]
        a2 -->|Consume Message| a3[SqsListener Service]
    end

    a3 --> filechangedevent{{Received FileChanged Event}}:::Event
    filechangedevent --> getpackageident([Get Package Identifier]):::Action
    getpackageident --> checkpackage{Is Package Exist?}
    checkpackage -->|No| createpackage([Create Asset Package]):::Action
    checkpackage -->|Yes| checkasset{Is Asset Exist?}
    createpackage --> packagecreated{{Asset Package Created}}:::Event
    packagecreated --> checkasset
    checkasset -->|No| createasset([Create Asset]):::Action
    








    
